<acceptance_gate>
Contract tests use only an injected transport and sanitized recorded fixtures under `tests/fixtures/research/`. Outbound `fetch` is stubbed to throw. Generation is never accepted if tests contact live MiniMax or spend credits.
</acceptance_gate>

<deliverables>
